@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title OpenData Version 3.0.0 System Context
left to right direction
actor "Operator / External Scheduler" as Operator
rectangle "OpenData Java Application" as App
rectangle "JavaFX Desktop Interface" as GUI
rectangle "Command-line Interface" as CLI
file "Bootstrap and Override Properties" as Config
cloud "Ofgem" as Ofgem
cloud "Open-Meteo" as Meteo
folder "Octopus Statement PDFs" as Octopus
folder "Work, Archive, Logs and Help" as Files
database "OpenData SQL Server
configuration, audit and plugin data" as Database

Operator --> GUI : interactive desktop use
Operator --> CLI : commands / scheduling
GUI --> App : shared services/gateways
CLI --> App : parsed operations
App --> Config : read / bootstrap rewrite
App --> Ofgem : HTTPS page and XLSX
App --> Meteo : HTTPS JSON API
App --> Octopus : read local PDFs
App --> Database : pooled JDBC
App --> Files : work, archive, logs and help
@enduml
